{"event":"changes_requested","job_id":"docs-reporting-donation-campaigns","reason":"Full pinned raw read and SHA-256 match the trusted input and accepted receipt; candidate/suggestions and all five quotes are exact. The dashboard latency, campaign prerequisite, per-donation Processed versus grouped nonprofit Received grain, currencies, time zones, column configuration and financial-outcome boundaries are supported. One retained role claim is misleading across related authority: this 2021-modified donation guide says 'These user roles do not give access to any other payment information' after a table that includes Merchant financial (raw lines 31-39). The 2024-modified User roles reference, captured on the same date, says Merchant financial can view payment analytics, conversion/external-settlement reports, payouts, invoices and balances (raw/adyen/docs/account/user-roles/2026-09-15.md:76-92). The candidate and fixed Q2 repeat the blanket no-other-information claim without the conflict. A reader assigning Merchant financial to generate Received Donations could incorrectly treat it as donation-only access."}
